{"type":"message","id":"87d80d23","parentId":"8f572494","timestamp":"2026-08-01T01:00:00.288Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:rules-refresh-daily Cursor协作规则刷新] 【每日规则刷新】请记住以下 Cursor 协作规则（每天提醒一次）：\n\n1. 当用户要求让 Cursor 做某件事时，必须执行：\npython \"C:\\ADHD_agent\\.cursor\\skills\\async-notify\\scripts\\submit_task.py\" --title \"任务标题\" --instructions \"具体指令\" --submitted-by \"OpenClaw\" --notify\n\n2. 当用户回复了 Cursor 发来的飞书确认消息时，必须执行：\npython \"C:\\ADHD_agent\\.cursor\\skills\\async-notify\\scripts\\confirm_write.py\" --task-id \"task_id\" --decision auto --reply \"用户回复原文\"\n\n3. 查看当前 Cursor 任务队列：\npython \"C:\\ADHD_agent\\.cursor\\skills\\async-notify\\scripts\\submit_task.py\" --list\n\n4. 查看已完成任务结果：\npython \"C:\\ADHD_agent\\.cursor\\skills\\async-notify\\scripts\\submit_task.py\" --results\n\n以上规则已写入 AGENTS.md，请确认记住。无需回复，静默确认即可。\nCurrent time: Saturday, August 1st, 2026 — 09:00 (Asia/Shanghai) / 2026-08-01 01:00 UTC\n\nReturn your summary as plain text; it will be delivered automatically. If the task explicitly calls for messaging a specific external recipient, note who/where it should go instead of sending it yourself."}],"timestamp":1785546000285}}
{"type":"message","id":"d8d4ae84","parentId":"87d80d23","timestamp":"2026-08-01T01:01:33.040Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is a cron job notification reminding me of Cursor collaboration rules. The user says \"无需回复，静默确认即可\" (no need to reply, just silently confirm). So I should just acknowledge internally and not send any message back."},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n已收到。Cursor 协作规则已确认：\n1. submit_task.py — 提交任务给 Cursor\n2. confirm_write.py — 处理用户对 Cursor 确认消息的回复\n3. submit_task.py --list — 查看任务队列\n4. submit_task.py --results — 查看已完成结果\n\n静默确认，无需回复。\n</final>"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1785546000287}}
